      "blurb": "Predatory pack hunter with venomous bite",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Varren are predatory pack hunters with an unusual capacity for loyalty that makes them the galaxy's most common dangerous animal kept as a companion. Wild varren are another matter-territorial, aggressive in numbers, and equipped with serrated dentition and a venom delivery system that causes significant bleeding. They have been introduced to multiple ecosystems through krogan colonization and are an invasive species on seven Terminus worlds.</p><p><strong>Pack Hunter:</strong> When the varren has at least one ally within 10 feet of its target, it deals 1d6 extra piercing damage on a successful Strike.</p><p><strong>Varren Venom:</strong> A creature bitten by a varren takes 1d6 persistent bleed damage (DC 18 Fortitude save negates the persistent damage; half duration on success).</p>",
